From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Youwes09 <yuvi.shen@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 10:43:09 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] rust: thermal: Add cooling device registration

Let Rust drivers register a cooling device with the thermal core, bound
to the zones whose cooling maps name the device's node. A device that
implements the optional power callbacks is a power actor, so the power
allocator governor can budget it.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Youwes09 <yuvi.shen@outlook.com>
---
 rust/bindings/bindings_helper.h |   1 +
 rust/kernel/lib.rs              |   2 +
 rust/kernel/thermal.rs          | 231 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 234 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 rust/kernel/thermal.rs

